# Two North Wind Avatars. The first, cast on turn 1, brings Lightning Bolt into Bot1's hand; that card is in the game now and stays
# there until it ends (CR 400.11b), so when the second Avatar is cast on turn 3 its trigger offers only what is still outside the
# game: Counterspell, not the Bolt in hand. Bot1 takes Counterspell, and the sideboard is empty.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
North Wind Avatar
Mountain
Island
North Wind Avatar
Island x10

[Bot1 Sideboard]
Lightning Bolt
Counterspell

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

